{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
To enable RabbitMQ at boot and start it now, run as root:

sysrc rabbitmq_enable=YES
service rabbitmq start

To enable the optional management console, run as root:

su -m rabbitmq -c 'env HOME=/var/db/rabbitmq rabbitmq-plugins enable rabbitmq_management'

The console is available at http://localhost:15672/ with the default local
guest:guest account. Configure a dedicated account for administration.

See https://www.rabbitmq.com/docs for install help, and
https://www.rabbitmq.com/docs/configure for further options.
EOM
